ammiferi... ed a combinare guai.","language":"it-IT"},"tagline":{"value":"A feast for the senseless.","language":"en-US"},"releaseDate":"1998-04-15","status":"Released","rating":7.8,"ratingCount":2126,"genres":["Commedia"],"countries":["France"],"facts":{"Runtime":"80m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":35323,"name":"Jacques Villeret","role":"François Pignon","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/w4sONhPYO3c361BPxDToT4pJFpY.jpg"},{"id":21177,"name":"Thierry Lhermitte","role":"Pierre Brochant","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/50kQVqmD1XnGRlgTPsVRhECaRae.jpg"},{"id":26887,"name":"Francis Huster","role":"Juste Leblanc","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lMe0m7E9bE6omevGSPgoEo9GTQX.jpg"},{"id":24832,"name":"Daniel Prévost","role":"Lucien Cheval","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oXgHTf056G7gjS290Nadn05CbPT.jpg"},{"id":53425,"name":"Alexandra Vandernoot","role":"Christine Brochant","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qfIFGsamsqi8yDsdBY6VNuG6QPG.jpg"},{"id":20080,"name":"Catherine Frot","role":"Marlène Sasseur","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pi1HwK9gJfhkDJkC3SCDJgDc9LS.jpg"},{"id":53201,"name":"Edgar Givry","role":"Jean Cordier","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/toHR2ZWiQz8TP8P5WM0v7PokwiK.jpg"},{"id":145738,"name":"Christian Pereira","role":"Doctor Sorbier","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gKoHEHRlZaN1X3Xj4zUWmNK7g6k.jpg"},{"id":1403436,"name":"Benoît Bellal","role":"Bichaud, first animator","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5uMa0ibXexdhopsTb7quPq1DsMZ.jpg"},{"id":1403437,"name":"Jacques Bleu","role":"Third animator","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tBXZfqefoDPrW9K0QVkBEE9hI4a.jpg"},{"id":145197,"name":"Philippe Brigaud","role":"Boomerang enthusiast guest","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/53XO45oLt2hn3g7Wz6CQSYlB4tW.jpg"},{"id":146640,"name":"Michel Caccia","role":"Guest","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gTLWKysANfv7hp27Ir03KEHPR7I.jpg"},{"id":585717,"name":"Laurent Gendron","role":"Guest","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nNck3Fc1weOBtdW3HzJUmRY3pCc.jpg"},{"id":1429797,"name":"Pétronille Moss","role":"Louisette Blond","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zu39NI2GkU5uG3tHEULRL1V2V9K.jpg"},{"id":647402,"name":"Pierre-Arnaud Juin","role":"Boissonade","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/d9kiSajEjRtc9XHAlR3TD6iPPEC.jpg"},{"id":538398,"name":"Daniel Martin","role":"Messignac","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fUalx2UASfEKzJ3AKHEa51ys9L.jpg"},{"id":2571903,"name":"Elvire Melliere","role":"Gisèle","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pU1vVY9R1SsrM0eeH73s05xzcPW.jpg"},{"id":72336,"name":"Rémy Roubakha","role":"Carlier","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/axlTejkf7WgleB1ogT5Hs5yTqy6.jpg"},{"id":1783603,"name":"Candide Sanchez","role":"Guest","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yzLcNMfcMHqY20tdUfo2Vd5BuTt.jpg"},{"id":1389713,"name":"Mykhaël Georges-Schar","role":"Second animator"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"La cena dei cretini","overview":"Pierre ed i suoi amici ogni mercoledì sera organizzano una cena un pò particolare, alla quale ciascuno di loro deve portare un cretino e chi porta un idiota perfetto vince il premio in palio. Pierre stavolta è sicuro di vincere: ha portato François Pignon un contabile del Ministero delle Finanze specializzato in costruzioni con i fiammiferi... ed a combinare guai."},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Dinner Game","overview":"For Pierre Brochant and his friends, Wednesday is “Idiots' Day”. The idea is simple: each person has to bring along an idiot. The one who brings the most spectacular idiot wins the prize. Tonight, Brochant is ecstatic. He has found a gem. The ultimate idiot, “A world champion idiot!”. What Brochant doesn’t know is that Pignon is a real jinx, a past master in the art of bringing on catastrophes...","tagline":"A feast for the senseless."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Tous les mercredis, Pierre Brochant et ses amis organisent un dîner où chacun doit amener un con. Celui qui a trouvé le plus spectaculaire est déclaré vainqueur. Ce soir, Brochant exulte, il est sûr d’avoir trouvé la perle rare, un con de classe mondiale: François Pignon, comptable au ministère des Finances et passionné de modèles réduits en allumettes. Ce qu’il ignore c’est que Pignon est passé maître dans l’art de déclencher des catastrophes.","tagline":"Un con de classe mondiale !"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qvGnAgd5xYVSJmDzuLzt1Slg1mq.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qvGnAgd5xYVSJmDzuLzt1Slg1mq.png","language":"it","width":359,"height":465},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xGeGY8oNAjUl3Ldetpw7kY5QJ5s.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xGeGY8oNAjUl3Ldetpw7kY5QJ5s.png","language":"it","width":1121,"height":158},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fz0tEXW88v0Gky5geSfdlV3G0ub.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fz0tEXW88v0Gky5geSfdlV3G0ub.png","language":"en","width":805,"height":683},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cqzB3YdA78lJGb5vJWaENjsZsg3.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cqzB3YdA78lJGb5vJWaENjsZsg3.png","language":"fr","width":5429,"height":5289},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rJhvgKMJSIloRdYLV5ByfjS7WZI.svg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rJhvgKMJSIloRdYLV5ByfjS7WZI.svg","language":"fr","width":1303,"height":1269},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kFjjn42B27fYF5UwMxgyVSpiN2k.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kFjjn42B27fYF5UwMxgyVSpiN2k.png","language":"fr","width":1301,"height":1269},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kOCC4lpgU058gGEOkJAAUKsRg8Q.png",